💭 Stores T boxed, which its specialized methods read and write through the box.
🕊 🎁🐚T 🔼🍆 🍇
  🖍🆕 value T
  🖍🆕 previous T
  🆕 🍼 value T 🍇
    value ➡️ 🖍previous
  🍉
  ❗️ 🔓 ➡️ T 🍇
    ↩️ value
  🍉
  🖍❗️ 🔄 new T 🍇
    value ➡️ 🖍previous
    new ➡️ 🖍value
  🍉
  ❗️ 🧮 ➡️ 🔢 🍇
    ↩️ 📏 value❗️ ➕ 📏 previous❗️
  🍉
  🖍❗️ 🆙 ➡️ 🔢 🍇
    ↩️ ⬆️value❗️
  🍉
🍉

💭 Stores an optional T boxed, like T.
🕊 🎀🐚T 📦🍆 🍇
  🖍🆕 value T
  🖍🆕 spare 🍬T
