    🍉
    ↩️ 📏 value❗️
  🍉
  ❗️ 🔀 ➡️ 🍬T 🍇
    ↩️ spare
  🍉
  🖍❗️ 🔄 new T 🍇
    value ➡️ 🖍spare
    new ➡️ 🖍value
  🍉
  🖍❗️ 🧹 🍇
    🤷‍♀️ ➡️ 🖍spare
  🍉
