💭 Stores callables, which take and return T boxed, so specialized methods call them like generic code.
🕊 🏭🐚T 📦🍆 🍇
  🖍🆕 make 🍇🔢➡️T🍉
  🖍🆕 check 🍇T➡️🔢🍉
  🆕 🍼 make 🍇🔢➡️T🍉 🍼 check 🍇T➡️🔢🍉 🍇🍉
  ❗️ 🔨 n 🔢 ➡️ 🔢 🍇
    ⁉️ make n❗️ ➡️ made
    ↩️ 📏 made❗️ ➕ ⁉️ check made❗️
  🍉
  🖍❗️ 🔧 🍇
    make ➡️ old
    🍇🎍🥡 n 🔢 ➡️ T
      ↩️ ⁉️ old n ✖️ 2❗️
    🍉 ➡️ 🖍make
  🍉
🍉

💭 Its initializers are specialized too.
🕊 🔳🐚T 🔼🍆 🍇
  🖍🆕 first T
  🖍🆕 values 🍨🐚T🍆
  🖍🆕 count 🔢 ⬅️ 100

  🆕 🍼 first T 🍇
    🍿 first 🍆 ➡️ 🖍values
  🍉

  🆕 ▶️🔃 value T times 🔢 🍇
    value ➡️ 🖍first
    🍿🍆 ➡️ 🖍values
    🔂 i 🆕⏩ 0 times❗️ 🍇
      🐻values value❗️
    🍉
    📏 value❗️ ➡️ 🖍count
  🍉

  🆕 ▶️🔀🐚U 🔼🍆 value T other U 🍇
    value ➡️ 🖍first
    🍿 value 🍆 ➡️ 🖍values
    📏 other❗️ ➡️ 🖍count
  🍉

  ❗️ 🧮 ➡️ 🔢 🍇
    0 ➡️ 🖍🆕 sum
    🔂 value values 🍇
      sum ⬅️➕ 📏 value❗️
    🍉
    ↩️ sum ➕ 📏 first❗️ ➕ count
  🍉
🍉


